@startuml UC-92 Reject Lesson Plan - Sequence Diagram (stereo)
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 280

actor Moderator
participant ":LessonPlanApprovalScreen" as UI <<user interaction>>
participant ":TextPromptDialog" as PROMPT <<user interaction>>
participant ":WeeklyTaskController" as CTL <<coordinator>>
participant ":WeeklyTaskService" as SVC <<business logic>>
participant ":WeeklyTaskRepository" as REPO <<interface>>
database DB

autonumber
Moderator ->> UI : Click "Reject" on an eligible submission of the approval list
activate UI
UI ->> PROMPT : Show the rejection popup with the required reason field
activate PROMPT

opt the reason is still empty or the moderator cancels the rejection
  Moderator ->> PROMPT : Leave the reason field empty or click "Cancel"
  PROMPT -->> Moderator : Keep the "Reject" action disabled with MSG02 under the field, or close the popup and record no decision
end

Moderator ->> PROMPT : Enter the rejection reason and click "Reject"
PROMPT ->> UI : Report the confirmed rejection with the entered reason
deactivate PROMPT
UI ->> UI : handleReject(id, reason)
UI ->> CTL : POST /api/weekly-tasks/{id}/rejection
activate CTL
CTL ->> SVC : reject(id, rawReason)
activate SVC
SVC ->> REPO : findById(id)
activate REPO
REPO ->> DB : SELECT * FROM weekly_tasks WHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB -->> REPO : row / none
deactivate DB
REPO -->> SVC : WeeklyTask
deactivate REPO
SVC ->> SVC : require a non-empty reason and accept only a submission still in SUBMITTED status inside the moderator assigned subject (BR-18)

alt the reason is empty, or the submission is unavailable, already processed or outside the assigned subject
  SVC -->> CTL : IllegalArgumentException / ResourceNotFoundException / ForbiddenOperationException
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 400 / 404 / 403
  UI -->> Moderator : Show MSG02 for the empty reason or MSG25 for the unavailable submission, and keep every status unchanged
else the reason is entered and the submission is SUBMITTED in the assigned subject
  SVC ->> REPO : save(task with REJECTED status, the reason, the reviewing moderator and the review time)
  activate REPO
  REPO ->> DB : UPDATE weekly_tasks SET review_status = 'REJECTED', rejection_reason = ?, reviewed_by = ?, reviewed_at = ? WHERE id = ?
  activate DB
  DB -->> REPO : Saved
  deactivate DB
  REPO -->> SVC : WeeklyTask
  deactivate REPO
  SVC ->> SVC : record the rejection with its reason in the activity log and inform the assigned teacher of the review result (see UC-93)
  SVC -->> CTL : WeeklyTaskDetail
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 200 + WeeklyTaskDetail
  UI ->> UI : load()
  UI -->> Moderator : Show MSG08, leave the Community Hub publish status untouched and refresh the approval list
end
deactivate SVC
deactivate CTL
deactivate UI
@enduml
